### 1. Test Connectivity
GET http://localhost:8080/jesus/everest2026/facturas/vts_api_service.php?action=test HTTP/1.1
X-User-ID: admin-user-01

### 2. List All Invoices
GET http://localhost:8080/jesus/everest2026/facturas/vts_api_service.php?action=list HTTP/1.1

### 3. Fetch Ledger (Alias for List)
GET http://localhost:8080/jesus/everest2026/facturas/vts_api_service.php?action=fetch_ledger HTTP/1.1

### 4. Verify Chain Integrity
GET http://localhost:8080/jesus/everest2026/facturas/vts_api_service.php?action=verify HTTP/1.1

### 5. Export for AEAT
GET http://localhost:8080/jesus/everest2026/facturas/vts_api_service.php?action=export HTTP/1.1

### 6. Generate Hash (Utility)
POST http://localhost:8080/jesus/everest2026/facturas/vts_api_service.php?action=hash HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "dataToHash": "Texto de prueba para generar hash"
}

### 7. Register New Invoice (INITIAL)
POST http://localhost:8080/jesus/everest2026/facturas/vts_api_service.php?action=register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json


{
    "type": "INITIAL",
    "recipientNIF": "12345678",
    "recipientName": "Juan Pérez",
    "concept": "Servicios de Consultoría",
    "tipoIVA": "21",
    "baseImponible": 1500.50
}

### 8. Register Rectificative Invoice (RECTIFICATIVA)
# Note: originalInvoiceId must exist in the database.
POST http://localhost:8080/jesus/everest2026/facturas/vts_api_service.php?action=register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-ID: certificado-demo-123

{
    "type": "RECTIFICATIVA",
    "recipientNIF": "12345678",
    "recipientName": "Juan Pérez",
    "originalInvoiceId": 1,
    "concept": "Devolución Parcial por Ajuste",
    "amount": -200.00,
    "reason": "Error en cálculo de horas"
}

### 9. Reset Database (DEV ONLY)
POST http://localhost:8080/jesus/everest2026/facturas/vts_api_service.php?action=reset_db HTTP/1.1
